    "description": "Smoking Pipe Lot - 4 Pieces\nMixed Woods, Tobacco Pipes\nVintage\nThis collection features four distinct tobacco smoking pipes, each showcasing different materials and craftsmanship styles. From classic smooth briar-style finishes to rustic natural bark construction, this lot offers a variety of pieces for collectors or restoration enthusiasts. These vintage pipes reflect mid-20th-century smoking accessories and functional art.\nItems Included:\nSmooth dark wood pipe with black plastic stem and silver-tone decorative band\nRustic natural bark pipe with T-joint construction and untreated wood stem\nRough-textured matte wood pipe with a tapered black plastic stem\nPolished dark wood pipe with two engraved rings on the bowl rim and brown stem\nCondition:\nUsed vintage condition. Bowls show interior charring from previous use. The rustic bark pipe has a visible vertical crack in the bowl rim. Stems show light oxidation and tooth wear. Surface scuffs, finish wear, and scratches are present throughout the lot consistent with age.",
